{"id":"f41b3be50448ef3b","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-language-residual-equivalence.md","title":"Myhill–Nerode Equivalence","display":"df-myhill-nerode-equivalence — Myhill–Nerode Equivalence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-language-residual-equivalence","aliases":["73-df-language-residual-equivalence","73-df-myhill-nerode-equivalence"],"display":"df-myhill-nerode-equivalence — Myhill–Nerode Equivalence","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-language-residual-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-language-residual-equivalence</span><span>73-df-myhill-nerode-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-myhill-nerode-equivalence — Myhill–Nerode Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span> (language)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[x]_L\">\\([x]_L\\)</span> 仅在此词域调用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}myhill\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\nx\\equiv_L y\\leftrightarrow\nx,y\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\n\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(xz\\in L\\leftrightarrow yz\\in L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}myhill\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\nx\\equiv_L y\\leftrightarrow\nx,y\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\n\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(xz\\in L\\leftrightarrow yz\\in L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}myhill\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n[x]_L\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\Sigma^*:y\\equiv_L x\\},\\qquad\n\\Sigma^*/{\\equiv_L}\\coloneqq\\{[x]_L:x\\in\\Sigma^*\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{ind}(L)\\coloneqq|\\Sigma^*/{\\equiv_L}|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}myhill\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n[x]_L\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\Sigma^*:y\\equiv_L x\\},\\qquad\n\\Sigma^*/{\\equiv_L}\\coloneqq\\{[x]_L:x\\in\\Sigma^*\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{ind}(L)\\coloneqq|\\Sigma^*/{\\equiv_L}|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reflexivity, symmetry, and transitivity follow pointwise from logical equivalence; right concatenation preserves the relation.</li>\n<li>The original use of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\coloneqq\">\\(\\coloneqq\\)</span> between the two membership tests has been replaced by logical equivalence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ (alphabet, see [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"[x]_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}myhill\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\nx\\equiv_L y\\leftrightarrow\nx,y\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\n\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(xz\\in L\\leftrightarrow yz\\in L)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}myhill\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n[x]_L\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\Sigma^*:y\\equiv_L x\\},\\qquad\n\\Sigma^*/{\\equiv_L}\\coloneqq\\{[x]_L:x\\in\\Sigma^*\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{ind}(L)\\coloneqq|\\Sigma^*/{\\equiv_L}|","display":true},{"tex":"\\coloneqq","display":false}],"bytes":1261,"backlinks":[{"id":"54826de3b846056d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$、$x,y\\in\\Sigma^*$；$\\equiv_L$ 见 [[73-df-language-residual-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"ce1461d3e7bc342b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ind}(L)$ (Myhill–Nerode index, see [[73-df-language-residual-equivalence]])"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}